  "selection": "main compiled reverse AD iff main/lane forwards agree in the recorded neighbourhood and main AD agrees with the lane finite difference within 1e-6 relative error; otherwise the lane finite difference. For the 36 ice-thermodynamic entries [c, 1|3|4, 2] (outputs h_ice, T_surface, e_ice with respect to h_snow at h_snow = 0.0 on the 12 h_ice = 0.5 cases), the base point h_snow = 0.0 executes the h_snow <= 0.0 no-snow branch while h_snow > 0.0 crosses the strict h_snow > 0.0 guard into the snow-present branch (so the right difference disagrees on 31 of the 36 entries), so these 36 entries are scored against the left (backward) difference at the 1e-6 refinement step along the executed h_snow <= 0.0 branch. Statement-boundary candidates ([c, :, 1] at h_ice = 0.0, and [c, :, 16], [c, 2, 2], [c, 5, 2] at h_ice = 0.5) are excluded as non-differentiable only where measured left and right one-sided lane finite differences disagree by more than both 1e-6 relative error and 1x the entry's own fd_rounding_bound (|fd_right - fd_left| > max(1e-6 * max(|fd_left|, |fd_right|, tiny), fd_rounding_bound))",
  "fd_rounding_bound_formula": "per-entry float64 subtraction rounding bound of the lane finite-difference stencil, using s(x+-d) = max(|f(x+-d)|, d) on diagonal state entries (output_index == input_index) where the perturbed state leaf enters the column step at scale >= d and s(x+-d) = |f(x+-d)| otherwise, with s(x) = |f(x)|: (|spacing(s(x+d))| + |spacing(s(x-d))|) / (2*d) for central differences, (|spacing(s(x+d))| + |spacing(s(x))|) / d for forward differences, (|spacing(s(x))| + |spacing(s(x-d))|) / d for backward differences, and the 0.5-weighted sum of the two forward-step bounds for two-step averaged evaporation differences; boundary candidates are excluded only when |fd_right - fd_left| > max(1e-6 * max(|fd_left|, |fd_right|, tiny), fd_rounding_bound), and each unexcluded entry passes iff relative_error <= 1e-6 or |error| <= 1x fd_rounding_bound",
  "method_legend": {
    "0": "main_ad",
    "1": "lane_fd_central",
    "2": "lane_fd_forward",
    "3": "lane_fd_backward",
    "4": "excluded_nondifferentiable_boundary"
  },
